Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.84,0:01:00.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未知来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:10.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我妈出差 过来玩 免费晚餐）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:11.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安珀：再加码）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:13.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（酒柜解锁）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:15.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安珀：成交）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:24.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未知来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:31.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（电话一直响个不停）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:33.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安珀：卫斯还在烦你吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.94,0:01:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.47,0:01:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝汀娜在吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Cristina there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.56,0:01:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不在 你要留言吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's not available. May I take a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我是她聚会的朋友 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sorry. I'm a friend from her group… Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.53,0:01:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From her shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.93,0:01:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她说我是聚会的查理 她有我号码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just tell her I'm from group. I'm Charlie. She's got my number.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:01:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她参加你的聚会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she goes to your group?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.95,0:02:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她说查理打来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just tell her Charlie called.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 查理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will do exactly that, Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得告诉我是什么会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}once you tell me what kind of group we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒酒无名会戒毒会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it AA? NA?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听起来跟她说的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound exactly like she describes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在聚会上说到我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, does she talk about me in group?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.55,0:02:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不方便多说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I don't think I can really talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是怎么说我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she say about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she loves you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爱我什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she love about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爱你充满创意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loves that you're creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢艺术也爱看电视 电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love art and TV and movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都爱看电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, lots of people love movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但她说你爱看恐怖片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but she says you love scary movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.94,0:02:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你们的共同兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that you guys have that in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.27,0:02:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把你调教成恐怖片迷很骄傲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's proud of making a fan out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She is? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天她跟我说 她在猜…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she told me the other day, she wonders…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢哪部恐怖片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's your favorite scary movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:52.64,Title,0,0,0,0,,《鬼敲门》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… The Babadook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,探讨身为人母的悲伤与哀愁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an amazing meditation on motherhood and grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:02:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有点假掰吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that a little fancy pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那算是高级恐怖片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's elevated horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,高级恐怖片是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. What does that mean, "Elevated horror"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.65,0:03:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了吓人还有复杂情感和深层主题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's scary but with complex emotional and thematic underpinnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.55,0:03:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是低级老套和不合理的突发惊吓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just some schlocky, cheeseball nonsense with wall-to-wall jump scares.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Sounds kind of boring to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:19.86,Title,0,0,0,0,,你看过《惊声尖叫》吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever seen Stab?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像看过一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,12岁去朋友家过夜看的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a sleepover when I was, like, 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:30.27,Title,0,0,0,0,,你住在伍兹柏勒不知道《惊声尖叫》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live in Woodsboro and you don't know Stab?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.41,0:03:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈超爱那部电影 老是在聚会上说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother loves that movie. She talks about it all the time in group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,原版电影你记得多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How well do you remember the original?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.85,0:03:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 超90年代的fu{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I mean, it was super '90s.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光打太亮 演员发型都很俗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was really over-lit and everyone had weird hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得开场戏吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. Do you remember the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是杀人场景 都嘛是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started with a kill scene, right? They always started with a kill scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 一点都没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名少女独自在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a girl at home, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,接错电话然后开始跟凶手聊天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She answers a wrong number and starts talking with the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要她玩一个游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who makes her play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩一个游戏吗…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to play a game…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:24.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（门都已上锁）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,保全系统启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All systems armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:29.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（是个变态 我正在锁门）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安珀：什么你没事吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:49.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（没事）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:04:59.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安珀：你应该接电话）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:11.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你怎么知道我的市话在响）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:19.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安珀）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:20.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我不是安珀）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:24.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（快接电话 小贱货）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:30.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不接电话安珀就会死）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好笑 安珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't fucking funny, Amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 我不是安珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, this isn't Amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.27,0:05:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安珀今晚看起来特别漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber's looking particularly fetching tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不该随便乱放手机让别人复制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She really shouldn't leave her phone lying around for anyone to clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.55,0:05:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 我想玩一个游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:00.89,Title,0,0,0,0,,三个《惊声尖叫》问答题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stab movie trivia, three rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你报警她就死 答错了她就死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call the cops, she dies. You get a question wrong, she dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爸妈不在家 我15秒就能闯进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her parents aren't home. I can be in that room in 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要来个暖身题吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a warmup question?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得那些电影啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I don't know these movies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,问我知道的电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me about something I do know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:19.48,Title,0,0,0,0,,像是《灵病》和《宿怨》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me about It Follows. Ask me about Hereditary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:20.88,Title,0,0,0,0,,还有《女巫》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me about The Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.01,0:06:23.05,Title,0,0,0,0,,在第一部《惊声尖叫》中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the first Stab movie,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个伍兹柏勒镇民成为电影系列主角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what Woodsboro native was introduced as the franchise's main character?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,席妮皮斯考克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sidney Prescott!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,席妮皮斯考克 她住在榆树街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sidney Prescott and she lived on Elm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了 你很厉害啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct. You see, you're gonna do great at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 第一题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, question one…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答对了 应该算数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got that one right. It should count.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都能答对 只有上一集没有席妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone could have gotten that one right. Sidney's in every movie but the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question one:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:50.97,Title,0,0,0,0,,《惊声尖叫》系列改编自谁写的书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wrote the original book that the Stab movies are based on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视上那个女的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The… The chick from TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视上那个女的不算答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The chick from TV" is not gonna cut it, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖儿魏德斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale Weathers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是盖儿魏德斯 王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Gale Weathers, you motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了 安珀也许能活到日出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct. Amber might live to see the sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.69,0:07:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二题 谁演第一集开场戏的蠢妞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question two: Who played the dumb bitch in the beginning of Stab 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁接了电话然后被凶手千刀万剐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who answers the phone and gets carved up by the killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的答案吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the answer you're going with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没回答就算答错 时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A non-answer counts as a wrong answer, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴答…滴答…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ticktock, ticktock, ticktock, ticktock…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.39,0:07:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,海瑟葛拉罕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather Graham!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.19,0:07:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了 算你厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct! You pulled that one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now for the final question:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一集的凶手是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was the killer in Stab 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你这烂咖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know this one, you fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是比利鲁米斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Billy Loomis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是比利鲁米斯 席妮的男友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Billy Loomis, and he was Sidney's boyfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,路克威尔逊演的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was played by Luke Wilson,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.03,0:08:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got you, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it! I got it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 塔拉 你答错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry, Tara, but that's just not correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我答对了啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it is. It is. That is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确答案是比利鲁米斯和史都马克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The correct answer is Billy Loomis and Stu Macher.
