Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.23,0:16:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上面具杀光朋友然后爆红{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put on the mask, kill his friends, and get famous too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.36,0:16:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次是2011年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time it happened was in 2011.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还自愿跑来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we came here voluntarily?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得确定塔拉没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got to make sure Tara's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也得确定不会被疯子杀死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got to make sure we don't get sliced up by some lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:53.04,Title,0,0,0,0,,他看了《黑色星期五》就想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who saw Friday the 13th and thought, "You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.18,0:16:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个杰森的杀人手法真的很赞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Jason guy, he's got some pretty solid ideas."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:58.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伍兹柏勒）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能问个问题吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you one question though?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个戴着面具的人会想杀死你妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone wearing that mask would want to kill your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.51,0:17:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我男友瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my boyfriend, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 抱歉打扰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so nice to meet you. I'm so sorry if I'm intruding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你打来 - 不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you for calling. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你染了头发 我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at your hair! I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.70,0:17:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是双胞胎查德和敏蒂 还有卫斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are Chad and Mindy, the twins. And Wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.74,0:17:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当过他们的保母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to babysit them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:17:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都喜欢她这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is always how I like to be introduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有安珀 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Amber. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 见到你真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 我是瑞奇 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. I'm Richie. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈呢 - 她在伦敦开会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Mom? She's stuck at a conference in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才打过给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She called me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只讲了十分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, for all of ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉累了 应该让她休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, look, guys, Tara's really tired. Maybe we should just give her some space.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.57,0:18:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼 你别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都走吧 - 好喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But the rest. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你OK的话 我今晚可以睡这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's okay with you, I could sleep here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd really like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有吸入器吧 - 有 没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have your extra inhaler? - I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 宝贝 我就在外面 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - Okay, I'll be right outside. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼 我好害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她老姊是什么样的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is she like, the sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼珊曼超酷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? Oh, Sam is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为她让你穿宝可梦睡衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only say that because she let you wear Pokemon onesies to bed for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 一点也没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}True. That's a true statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪 珊曼一点都不酷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, trust me. Sam is not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.35,0:19:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爸甩掉她妈 珊曼13岁 塔拉才8岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her dad left her mom, right? Walks right out when Tara's eight, Sam's 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.80,0:19:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼开始变坏 被警察抓过几次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam started acting out, getting in trouble with the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一满18岁就一走了之{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, on Sam's 18th birthday, she leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,像鬼一样消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她变了 我不想看到塔拉再伤心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Sam's changed. I just don't want to see Tara hurt again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要保护塔拉不被亲生姊姊伤害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, you're protecting Tara from her own sister now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.15,0:19:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人保护她吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, someone has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,男生都配不上她 她连家人也不准见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so no guys are good enough for her, and now her family's off-limits too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人动机喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得不到她 谁也别想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If I can't have her, no one can."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 大家都知道你暗恋塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? We know you have a crush on Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.29,0:19:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了 敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come on, Mindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.73,0:19:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有嫌疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're all suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 除了丽芙 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Except maybe Liv. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太无趣不可能是变态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're way too boring to be a psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽芙 想来杯烈酒吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Liv. You want a real drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你想跟小屁孩一起混{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you happy sitting at this kids' table?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑版的麦克迈尔斯 她去年只是玩玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up, uglier Michael Myers, it was a summer fling. It meant nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有跟你讲话吗 - 我才不管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was I talking to you? - I don't care who you're talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丽芙 走吧 - 别跟她说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Liv, let's go. - Don't talk to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听到你的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我闭嘴 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut the fuck up. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.85,0:20:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再不滚我就报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here or I'm calling the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.82,0:20:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回头见 宝贝 - 去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll see you soon, sweetheart. - Hey, man, fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也一样 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kids too! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.36,0:20:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间酒吧有够烂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this bar, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.41,0:20:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you. Fuck it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗 帅哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you, pretty boy? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚出我的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my fucking car!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.49,0:22:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.40,0:22:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧 - 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.63,0:22:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个恶梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:21.89,Title,0,0,0,0,,Netflix上的《惊声尖叫》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Stab is on Netflix.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛我要有所准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I want to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.98,0:22:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去找东西吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go find something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.67,0:22:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 珊曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.81,0:23:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗精神病药没有以前有效了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Antipsychotics aren't working as well as they used to, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.88,0:23:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能逃避真正的自我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run from who you are, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.02,0:23:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几时才会告诉她为什么发生这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, when are you gonna tell her why all this is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.59,0:23:26.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安珀费里曼来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.27,0:23:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.57,0:23:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 珊曼莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Samantha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.90,0:23:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你家庭小秘密的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who knows your little family secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.25,0:23:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是伤害我妹的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the fuck who hurt my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.19,0:23:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不只是要伤害她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's not the only one I'm gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总得想办法让你回来 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to get you to come back here somehow, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.03,0:23:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想惹我 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to fuck with me, asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.33,0:23:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这儿 来找我啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here. Come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.73,0:23:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.23,0:24:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.99,0:24:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来啊 他想杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me! He's trying to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.76,0:24:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了你没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.00,0:24:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想在休息室杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody tried to kill me in the break room!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.41,0:24:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒吧外有具尸体 你又在这被攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a body outside a bar on Main, and now you get attacked here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.42,0:24:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是安珀打给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said the call came from Amber's number?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.22,0:24:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,又怎样他也用我手机打给塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? We know he cloned my phone before when he attacked Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.16,0:24:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 我只是猜的啦…你就是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, and I'm just spit-balling here… you're the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.93,0:24:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事的时候你又在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where were you when all this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.06,0:25:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在…看Netflix{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was… watching Netflix.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.03,0:25:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 超完美的不在场证明 - 你又在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Super-solid alibi, bro. - So where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.47,0:25:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在警局讯问安珀和她的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was questioning her at the sheriff's station.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.07,0:25:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到消息就马上赶来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I came as soon as I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.61,0:25:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看Netflix的藉口也不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, the Netflix alibi is good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.51,0:25:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都别再说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.74,0:25:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会派更多警察保护她 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna put more cops on her room, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.58,0:25:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.08,0:25:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也能把你们转到私人楼层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can move you to a private floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.75,0:25:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,副警长文森很尽职 你们会很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy Vinson knows what he's doing. You'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.12,0:25:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像现在这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we've been so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.19,0:25:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼莎 我们出去聊聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samantha, let's step outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.16,0:25:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 希克斯副警长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you, Deputy Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.00,0:25:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好多有趣的回忆 - 是希克斯警长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So many fun memories. - It's "Sheriff" Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.60,0:25:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也记得你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you too…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.47,0:25:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你为你家带来的麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the trouble you used to cause your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.04,0:25:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里没有帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your presence here is not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.24,0:25:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以也许天一亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe when the sun comes up,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.01,0:25:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你男友就该上路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and your boyfriend can hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.71,0:25:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让真正关心这社区的人处理这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave it to people who actually care about this community.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.09,0:26:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还是这么讨喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she remains a delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.83,0:26:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.26,0:26:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能出去一下我得跟塔拉谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, would you mind giving us a second? I need to talk to Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.13,0:26:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 Netflix 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Netflix. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.88,0:26:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得爸离开的事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember when Dad left?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.92,0:26:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parts, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.49,0:26:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才8岁 那重要吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was eight. I don't know what that has to do with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.59,0:26:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember how…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.57,0:26:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈放进阁楼的箱子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom used to keep those boxes up in the attic?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.27,0:26:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上去过一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was up there once,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.07,0:26:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我13岁那年去找圣诞礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was 13, looking for Christmas presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.74,0:26:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她在高中写的日记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I found these old diaries that she kept from high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.11,0:27:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珊曼 到底是… - 听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, what is… - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.22,0:27:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.15,0:27:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到一些旧日记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I found these old diaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.69,0:27:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道不对 但还是偷看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew it was wrong, but I read some anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.72,0:27:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为妈在高中就怀了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because Mom got pregnant with me in high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.03,0:27:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道她和爸是怎么认识的会很酷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought it could be cool to find out how she and Dad got together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.46,0:27:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定很浪漫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How romantic it must have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.67,0:27:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就偷看了日记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I read some.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.30,0:27:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一点都不浪漫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only it wasn't romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.14,0:27:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈和爸在约会 但…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom was dating Dad, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.01,0:27:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她却爱上另一个家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was in love with this other guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.01,0:27:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他害她怀孕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he got her pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.82,0:27:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟爸说是他的 所以他就向她求婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told Dad it was his, and that's why he proposed senior year.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.48,0:27:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼 你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.72,0:27:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时坐在阁楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sitting there, in this attic,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.62,0:27:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,才13岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm 13…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.29,0:27:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,却发现我爸不是我的生父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I just found out my dad isn't my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.66,0:27:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我冲进妈的房间大吼大叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I go find Mom in her bedroom, and I'm screaming at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.23,0:27:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把日记丢到她脸上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shoving this diary in her face,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.97,0:27:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I didn't even realize…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.14,0:27:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸就站在我后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Dad was standing right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.64,0:28:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被蒙在鼓里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.05,0:28:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,反而从我这里发现真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found out right then from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.89,0:28:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那晚就离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.39,0:28:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the reason he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.86,0:28:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 珊曼 - 妈从来没原谅我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Sam… - Mom never forgave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.09,0:28:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你太小 她逼我永远不能说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she made me promise never to tell you because you were so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.40,0:28:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才会变坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why I changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.50,0:28:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的关系也越来越疏离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got distant and weird with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.01,0:28:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑出去混 开始嗑能拿到的每种药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I went out and I started doing every drug that I could get my hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.35,0:28:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我受不了 然后离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I couldn't take it anymore and I left town.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.22,0:28:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能继续在你身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just couldn't be around you anymore, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.39,0:28:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是因为我毁了这个家 也因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only because I destroyed our family that night, but because…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.56,0:28:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从那些日记知道我的生父是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}those diaries told me who my real father was.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.40,0:28:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是比利鲁米斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Billy Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.10,0:29:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有人知道 所以才会伤害你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And somebody knows, and I think that's why you got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.24,0:29:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我没告诉你 反而离家出走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm so fucking sorry that I never told you and that I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.01,0:29:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的很抱歉 - 出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so sorry. - Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.47,0:29:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.94,0:29:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离开了五年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gone for five years…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.71,0:29:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,整整五年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five whole years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.91,0:29:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被刺伤你才回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I get stabbed and you want to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.95,0:29:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and drop all this shit on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.55,0:29:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为我在保护你 - 保护我什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought I was protecting you. - Protecting me from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.99,0:29:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.86,0:29:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我…拜托 塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, No, I… Please, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.76,0:29:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珊曼 - 给我滚出去 - 真的很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - I need you to get the fuck out. - I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.03,0:29:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珊曼 - 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.33,0:29:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.92,0:29:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 没事的 是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. It's okay, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.99,0:29:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在门外偷听吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you listening at the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.29,0:30:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.13,0:30:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 我有在偷听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah, I was listening at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.20,0:30:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生父是连环杀手…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't freak you out…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.60,0:30:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有吓到你吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my real father was a serial killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.57,0:30:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.14,0:30:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.98,0:30:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被吓死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great deal, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.48,0:30:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就走吧 我能理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, then go. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.58,0:30:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要留下来揪出凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got to stay and figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.58,0:30:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会丢下你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving you here, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.39,0:30:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看恐怖片有时候会想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that part in horror movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.02,0:30:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着角色大叫 学聪明点快逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you want to yell at the characters to be smart and get the fuck out?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.96,0:30:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这时候 瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is that part, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.46,0:30:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该快逃走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get the fuck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.40,0:30:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.17,0:30:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.98,0:30:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真是个蠢蛋 - 我是个蠢蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're such a dumbass. - I'm such a dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.78,0:30:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.08,0:30:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹不跟你说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your sister won't talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.05,0:30:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方也不会帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police aren't gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.99,0:31:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一步是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.16,0:31:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找一个专家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go talk to an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.50,0:31:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,周二及周三温度降到摄氏10度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}temperatures here Tuesday, Wednesday in the mid-50s,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.93,0:31:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周则将回升到摄氏15度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then finally we'll see those mid-60s returning next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.00,0:31:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名当地少女在家中遭到扮成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one night after a local teen was attacked in her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.47,0:31:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼脸杀手的嫌犯攻击后一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by an assailant wearing a Ghostface costume,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱蒂希克斯警长公布 又发生两起攻击案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Judy Hicks has now confirmed two more late-night attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.80,0:31:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,震惊伍兹柏勒小镇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that have left Woodsboro reeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.95,0:31:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一名受害者文森史奈德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first victim, Vincent Schneider,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.72,0:31:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在底袋撞球馆后遇害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was found dead behind the Corner Pocket Pool Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.29,0:31:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二名受害者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A second victim, as yet unnamed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.25,0:31:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,则是在伍兹柏勒综合医院内遇袭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was attacked inside Woodsboro General Hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.68,0:31:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她毫发无伤逃过一劫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but escaped without injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.56,0:31:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天伍兹柏勒镇民严阵以待…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needless to say, Woodsboro is on high alert today…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.26,0:31:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自洛克斐勒中心棚内直播{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live from Studio 1-A in Rockefeller Plaza…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.63,0:31:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 我是盖儿魏德斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. I'm Gale Weathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.40,0:31:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,节目开始之前 我想说个小故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we dive in, I want to tell you a little story.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.80,0:31:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就发生在我来这里的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that happened on the way into the studio this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.51,0:31:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去超商买培根起司蛋三明治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped to get a bacon… at a bodega, already a quintessentially New York…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.64,0:31:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.85,0:31:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你 莱利先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to bother you, Mr. Riley!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.35,0:32:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想问你几个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.35,0:32:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不接受采访{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give interviews.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.52,0:32:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是来采访你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not looking for an interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.79,0:32:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么要我跟你说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me one good reason why I should talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.89,0:32:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是比利鲁米斯的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Billy Loomis's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.70,0:32:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个超烂的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a terrible reason for me to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.07,0:32:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫珊曼莎卡本特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Samantha Carpenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.80,0:32:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚在医院受到攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was attacked last night at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.94,0:32:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹前晚被捅了七刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night before that, my sister was stabbed seven times.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.37,0:32:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定知道那种感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know what that's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.83,0:32:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想保护我家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to protect my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.01,0:32:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只求你给我五分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes. That's all I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.18,0:32:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你两分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.75,0:32:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在看节目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm missing a show I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.42,0:32:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我想留浏海 拜托阻止我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bangs again, stage an intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.52,0:32:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖儿魏德斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale Weathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.13,0:32:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们不是… - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Weren't you two, um… - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.14,0:32:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.30,0:32:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我男友瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is Richie, my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.51,0:32:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you known him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.37,0:33:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,半年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six months?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.68,0:33:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一开始就知道你爸是谁吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he know who your dad was when you met?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.65,0:33:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对伍兹柏勒镇或鬼脸杀手感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Express any interest in Woodsboro or the Ghostface killings?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.55,0:33:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.22,0:33:11.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,凶手很迷《惊声尖叫》 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your killer's obsessed with the Stab movies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.12,0:33:16.83,Title,0,0,0,0,,《惊声尖叫》系列电影有一些生存法则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there are certain rules to surviving a Stab movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.99,0:33:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.33,0:33:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一条法则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule number one:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.30,0:33:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不能信任恋爱对象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never trust the love interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.17,0:33:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,表面上看来细心体贴又可靠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seem sweet, caring, supportive. Then welcome to act 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.99,0:33:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了第三幕就会想杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where they're trying to rip your head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.07,0:33:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉遇袭时我和珊曼在莫德斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with Sam in Modesto when Tara was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.87,0:33:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜 她在医院被攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me guess, you were just in the other room,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.04,0:33:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚好在另一个房间却没人能证实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}conveniently unaccounted for when she was attacked at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.31,0:33:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得让这个邋遢大叔羞辱我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, do I have to take this from shitty Sam Elliott over here, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.78,0:33:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二条法则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule number two…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.29,0:33:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手的动机一定和过去有关联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the killer's motive is always connected to something in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.76,0:33:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是比利的女儿 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm related to Billy. - Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.56,0:33:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为何要杀死路人甲文斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then why kill that random Vince guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.91,0:33:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得自己查清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for you to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.10,0:33:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三条也是最重要的法则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And rule number three, and this is the most important rule:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.43,0:34:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手一定在第一名受害者的朋友圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first victim always has a friend group that the killer is a part of.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.11,0:34:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹有要好的朋友圈吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your sister have a close-knit group of friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.41,0:34:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.28,0:34:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.65,0:34:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个就是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then look for the killer there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.22,0:34:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出凶手犯案的动机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can find out why they're doing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.32,0:34:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会知道下一个是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can figure out who's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就帮助我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.92,0:34:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们揪出幕后凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us figure out who is behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.02,0:34:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑我被捅了九刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding me? I've been stabbed nine times.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.93,0:34:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经严重受损 还有只跛脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got permanent nerve damage and a fun little limp.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.53,0:34:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我想再来一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I want to do that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.60,0:34:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说一定和过去有关联 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just said it always goes back to the past, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.70,0:34:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有危险…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if I'm in danger…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.24,0:34:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就代表你也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that means you're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.14,0:34:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.64,0:34:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们携手合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.18,0:34:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.29,0:34:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.86,0:34:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在电影里比较好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's way more fun in the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.83,0:34:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 现在要怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.63,0:35:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.70,0:35:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了 凯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks so much for that, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.53,0:35:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,气象报告后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming up after our local weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.00,0:35:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要谈谈和老朋友重聚的好与坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pros and cons of reuniting with old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.33,0:35:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.63,0:35:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,席妮 是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sid, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.47,0:35:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dewey?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.07,0:35:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 有多久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.61,0:35:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我趁送女儿上学前正在跑步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to get a run in before I take the girls to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.48,0:35:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.54,0:35:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 真的很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.55,0:35:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢马克好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you? How's Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.25,0:35:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会留住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll keep him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.85,0:35:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长当得怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are things in the sheriff's business?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.79,0:35:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 其实…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they're…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.52,0:36:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还不错 - 最近联络过盖儿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're fine. But, Sid… - Have you talked to Gale lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.79,0:36:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年多没联络了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not in a couple years.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.73,0:36:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们离婚了 但…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know things didn't end well with you guys, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.90,0:36:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,席妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.53,0:36:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,又开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.87,0:36:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.47,0:36:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴着鬼脸面具的凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some idiot in a Ghostface mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.08,0:36:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前有三人遇害 一人丧命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three attacks so far. One dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.88,0:36:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次感觉不太一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about this one just feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.68,0:36:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.89,0:36:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 你知道我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, you know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.59,0:36:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.49,0:36:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 所以才会问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. That's why I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.62,0:36:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.43,0:36:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.83,0:36:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你安全 你有枪吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}want you to be safe up there. Do you have a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.03,0:36:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是席妮皮斯考克 我当然有枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sidney fucking Prescott. Of course I have a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.70,0:36:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.20,0:36:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖儿知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Gale know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.27,0:36:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我待会就打给她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's my next call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.64,0:36:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要答应我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Sid, promise me:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.11,0:36:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你听到或看到什么新闻 千万别来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what you hear or what you see on the news, don't come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.61,0:37:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别介意 但我不会再去那个小镇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, Dewey. I have no intention of ever setting foot in that town again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.42,0:37:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.69,0:37:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dewey…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.59,0:37:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管凶手想杀谁 你一定能保护他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever this killer's after, I'm glad they have you to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.16,0:37:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意安全 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… you be safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.20,0:37:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.80,0:37:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴听到你声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.44,0:37:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 席妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.54,0:37:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 振作点 杜威{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get it together, Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.07,0:37:34.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（盖儿）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.07,0:37:41.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（鬼脸回来了 别来这里）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.61,0:37:47.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（希望你一切安好）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.40,0:37:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概不应该传笑脸的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably shouldn't have sent the smiley face.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.46,0:37:55.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我还是）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.81,0:38:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇靠 他来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit. He came.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定暂时协助你们调查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've decided to temporarily assist you in your investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.42,0:38:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.16,0:38:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙洗了澡不代表他应该配枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just because that guy showered doesn't mean he should have a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.54,0:38:56.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蓝迪米克斯纪念家庭剧院）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.47,0:38:59.49,Title,0,0,0,0,,你怎么对《惊声尖叫》这么熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know so much about the Stab movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.63,0:39:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族遗传{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Runs in her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.84,0:39:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝迪是我们的舅舅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Randy was our uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.21,0:39:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,安息吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}RIP.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.34,0:39:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我把大家都找来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said to bring everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.55,0:39:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 嫌疑犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, suspects!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.12,0:39:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥会很骄傲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother would be so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.82,0:39:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 玛莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Martha.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.16,0:39:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dewey! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.53,0:39:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.13,0:39:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.76,0:39:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老婆好吗 - 妈 可以了啦 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the wife? Mom, we're good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.67,0:39:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 玩得开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, kids, have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.37,0:39:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请敏蒂把大家找来是因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked Mindy to call everybody here, because…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.24,0:39:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有件事要告诉你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's something I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.65,0:39:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我搞清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.32,0:39:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是比利鲁米斯的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying that you're the daughter of Billy Loomis,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.72,0:39:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们其中一个是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, what, that one of us is the killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.92,0:39:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手说他知道我的秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The killer told me he knew my secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.32,0:39:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了让我回来才攻击塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He attacked Tara to lure me back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.23,0:40:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干嘛又马上杀死跟踪丽芙的烂咖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then why immediately go and murder some douche-nozzle that was stalking Liv?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.90,0:40:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我们其中一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why does it have to be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.53,0:40:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威警长呢也许他是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Deputy Dewey here? Maybe he's the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.30,0:40:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别介意喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.34,0:40:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 我的动机是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None taken, but what's my motive?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.67,0:40:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被捅了N次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got stabbed a billion times,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.61,0:40:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,被出名老婆狠甩 然后开始酗酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}got dumped by your famous wife and crawled into a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.68,0:40:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定有嫌疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's safe to say you're on the suspect list.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.01,0:40:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你才是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe you're the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.95,0:40:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你很会伤人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that cut deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.48,0:40:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个烂咖也有关联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That douche-nozzle is connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.39,0:40:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估狗过 他妈是莱丝莉马克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I googled him. His mom is Leslie Macher.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.99,0:40:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史都马克的妹妹 - 史都马克是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stu Macher's sister. - Who's Stu Macher?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.19,0:40:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利鲁米斯的共犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Billy Loomis's accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.60,0:40:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real loony tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.40,0:40:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.17,0:40:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,前三个受害者都跟原来的凶手有关联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the first three attacks are all on people related to the original killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.77,0:40:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他在拍重启续集{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. He's making a requel!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.47,0:40:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.47,0:40:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是传承续集 粉丝有不同说法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a legacyquel. Fans are torn on the terminology.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.81,0:40:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托讲白话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.94,0:40:50.28,Title,0,0,0,0,,记得去年的《惊声尖叫》续集吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the Stab movie that came out last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.41,0:40:52.92,Title,0,0,0,0,,对耶 《锋回路转》的导演导的嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah! The one the Knives Out guy directed?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.05,0:40:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我蛮喜欢那部电影的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually really liked that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.78,0:40:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啰 你的品味很差{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you did. You have terrible taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.55,0:40:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.99,0:41:00.66,Title,0,0,0,0,,《惊声尖叫》的铁粉超讨厌的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, the hard-core Stab fans hated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.79,0:41:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要上滴卡电影板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go on 4chan and Dreadit,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.16,0:41:05.19,Title,0,0,0,0,,大家都说《惊声尖叫8》毁了童年回忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all they're talking about is how Stab 8 pissed on their childhoods.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.33,0:41:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了更有深度硬要探讨社会议题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How they crammed in social commentary just to elevate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.35,0:41:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,女主角也是个玛丽苏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the main character's a Mary Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.27,0:41:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽苏是什么 - 你不会想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's a Mary Sue? - You really don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.93,0:41:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,高级恐怖片有什么不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with elevated horror?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.07,0:41:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔登皮尔超屌的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Jordan Peele fucking rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.10,0:41:17.27,Title,0,0,0,0,,那还用说 但那不是《惊声尖叫》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, obviously, but that's not Stab.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.41,0:41:22.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《惊声尖叫》只是部后设砍杀恐怖片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real Stab movies are meta slasher whodunits, full stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.21,0:41:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 那只是部电影 - 才不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. It's just a movie. - No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.68,0:41:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人觉得第一集是经典名片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To some people, the original is their favorite thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.08,0:41:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们爱上恐怖片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The movie that made them love horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.55,0:41:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们才十岁就看过 有共通的话题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Mom or Dad showed them when they were ten that bonded them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.89,0:41:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁敢侮辱那个回忆就会被骂翻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And God help anyone who slightly fucks with that special memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.49,0:41:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,更痛恨不尊重原版的作品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who makes a movie they think disrespects it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.66,0:41:43.93,Title,0,0,0,0,,看来凶手在拍自己的《惊声尖叫8》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like our killer is writing his own version of Stab 8,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.07,0:41:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是一部重启续集{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but doing it as a requel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.70,0:41:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.84,0:41:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能只是重启一个电影系列{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you can't just reboot a franchise from scratch anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.67,0:41:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然会被酸民出征{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fans won't stand for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.11,0:41:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色圣诞节 鬼娃恰吉 别闯阴阳界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Christmas, Child's Play, Flatliners…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.74,0:41:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种拍法很母汤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shit doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.21,0:41:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也不能直接拍续集{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't just do a straight sequel, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.75,0:42:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要有新的创意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to build something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.32,0:42:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也不能太新 粉丝会暴动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not too new, or the Internet goes bug-fucking nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.15,0:42:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须延续既有的故事线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got to be part of an ongoing story line,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.16,0:42:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算故事早就结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if the story shouldn't have been ongoing in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.66,0:42:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以有全新主角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}New main characters, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.23,0:42:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是要找回原版经典角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but supported by and related to legacy characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.96,0:42:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算重启 也不是续集{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite a reboot, not quite a sequel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.10,0:42:18.57,Title,0,0,0,0,,就像《月光光心慌慌》、《夺魂锯》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the new Halloween, Saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.70,0:42:20.84,Title,0,0,0,0,,《魔鬼终结者》、《侏罗纪公园》、《魔鬼克星》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminator, Jurassic Park, Ghostbusters…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.97,0:42:22.17,Title,0,0,0,0,,甚至《星际大战》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fuck, even Star Wars!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.30,0:42:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定都要回溯到原版的电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always, always goes back to the original!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.11,0:42:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我变成同人小说中的小角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me that I'm caught in the middle of fan-fucking-fiction?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.58,0:42:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不只是小角色 珊曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just in the middle, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.92,0:42:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是主角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.85,0:42:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别说得太复杂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, not to put too fine a point on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.89,0:42:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但根据重启续集的规则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, according to requel rules…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.26,0:42:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.93,0:42:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照故事模式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going by the pattern,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.63,0:42:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个跟之前的角色一定有关联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever it is has to be connected to someone that came before.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.34,0:43:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始后悔来这里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to regret coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.64,0:43:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈也是其中一个角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, my mom was a character in one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.41,0:43:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人鸟那些烂续集 卫斯 你很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one cares about the shitty inferior sequels, Wes. You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.15,0:43:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但蓝迪是舅舅 你跟我死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Randy as our uncle, though, you and I are probably screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.95,0:43:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 什么 - 或者你就是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. What? - Or you're the killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.65,0:43:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了替自己洗白才在这里练肖话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this whole elaborate monologue is just to cover your tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.49,0:43:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手是谁已经很明显了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's pretty clear who the killer is at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.36,0:43:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.33,0:43:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.83,0:43:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全符合重启续集的逻辑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes perfect requel sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.83,0:43:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是很合理 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That actually does make sense. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.81,0:43:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太扯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.78,0:43:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我回饭店等你 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meet you back at the motel. - Sam, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.08,0:43:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.82,0:43:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖片的第一条法则是别分开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first fucking rule of these movies is don't split up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.16,0:43:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真是个呛妞 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nerve of that girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.53,0:43:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没这个心情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really not in the mood right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.23,0:43:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Sam, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.40,0:43:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手还在逍遥法外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a killer on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.60,0:43:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想杀你和你妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's threatening you. He's threatening your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.70,0:44:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要像以前一样逃避自我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna run away from who you are like you always do,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.60,0:44:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是要善用它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or are you gonna use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.07,0:44:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.57,0:44:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.58,0:44:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要怎么活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how else are you gonna survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.81,0:44:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受真正的你 揪出真正的凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say accept who you are, let's get out there, find out who's doing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.75,0:44:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大开杀戒吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cut some fucking throats!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.82,0:44:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.26,0:44:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,多点一份毛豆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. And extra edamame. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.33,0:44:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我十分钟就到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I'll be there in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.33,0:44:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,掰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.84,0:44:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 是你吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you, tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.88,0:45:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.39,0:45:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有注意安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you being safe out there, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.96,0:45:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啦 我朋友都在笑我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the point that all my friends mock me, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.46,0:45:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才乖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.43,0:45:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚饭吃什么 - 寿司 我正要去拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's for dinner? Sushi. I was just leaving to pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.26,0:45:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不叫外送{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Why don't you just Postmates it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.57,0:45:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,送来就不新鲜了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it gets all smooshy by the time it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.10,0:45:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you hate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.14,0:45:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去洗澡 我很快就回来 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go shower. I'll be back soon. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.11,0:45:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我放回去 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you put this away for me? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.01,0:45:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱你唷 - 爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Love you. - Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.28,0:45:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得锁门 - 我会啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lock the door. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.97,0:46:29.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未知来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.82,0:46:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希克斯警长 - 你好 茱蒂警长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Hicks. Hello, Sheriff Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.52,0:46:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 你应该知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this? - I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.76,0:46:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最爱恐怖片 还有刀子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fan of scary movies. And knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.66,0:46:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的恐怖片是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your favorite scary movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.07,0:46:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢动画片和歌舞片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer animated films and musicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.50,0:46:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.64,0:46:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会全盘托出 我是打来自首的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you all about it. I'm calling to turn myself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.98,0:46:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.48,0:46:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,（凶手来电 追踪电话）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll sit down at the station,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.08,0:46:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会说出为什么要杀死那两个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll tell you about the two people I've killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.15,0:47:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只杀死了一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've only killed one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.62,0:47:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我见到你 你的宝贝儿子早就没命了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I see you, I'll have gutted your baby boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.03,0:47:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.52,0:47:16.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卫斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.87,0:47:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快接啊 卫斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up, Wes!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.05,0:47:20.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（妈妈来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.54,0:47:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是希克斯警长 立刻赶去我家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sheriff Hicks. I need units to converge on my house ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.71,0:47:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 马上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. We're on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.12,0:47:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,连络不到他 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't get him on the phone, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.35,0:47:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定在忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.92,0:47:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你在他附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know you're anywhere near him?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.26,0:47:45.16,Title,0,0,0,0,,看过《惊魂记》吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever seen the movie Psycho?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.81,0:47:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.04,0:48:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤害我儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't hurt my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.38,0:48:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.64,0:48:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个好孩子 - 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a good kid. - Is he, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.91,0:48:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没伤害过人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.52,0:48:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还不够好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.48,0:48:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 要我做什么都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.79,0:48:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赶不回去的 茱蒂警长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna make it in time, Sheriff Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.94,0:48:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.41,0:48:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.61,0:48:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.72,0:48:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.19,0:48:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.94,0:49:24.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未接来电 妈妈）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.95,0:51:10.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（冰箱里有柠檬冰块）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.08,0:51:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.94,0:51:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.48,0:52:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去…你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck… you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.23,0:53:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你不能进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss, you can't be here. You can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.73,0:53:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我认识她儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm sorry. I know her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.20,0:53:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她儿子卫斯… - 很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Her son, Wes. Is he… - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.51,0:53:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.46,0:53:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.60,0:53:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.40,0:53:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.93,0:53:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.14,0:54:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我没错啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.64,0:54:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧你好像很难过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay? You seem like you're having a bit of a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.77,0:54:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识警长吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know the sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.08,0:54:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.01,0:54:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不太喜欢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't like me very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.51,0:54:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不喜欢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't like me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.78,0:54:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是珊曼莎 珊曼卡本特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… I'm Samantha. Sam. Carpenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.72,0:54:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我妹被攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister and I were attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.35,0:54:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.52,0:54:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是盖儿…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Gale…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.93,0:54:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riley.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.10,0:54:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,魏德斯 我是盖儿魏德斯 失陪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weathers. I'm Gale Weathers. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.70,0:54:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 盖儿 - 一则简讯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale? - A text? - Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.04,0:54:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你传简讯告诉我凶手回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me the killer is back in a text?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.77,0:54:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很痛耶 - 活该{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ow, that hurts. - Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.81,0:54:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在上节目 - 你怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were on the air. - How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.55,0:54:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,直觉吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.12,0:54:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的气色不错 还在写书吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look good. Are you still writing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.02,0:54:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.29,0:54:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你写书的时候最开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always happiest when you were writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.73,0:55:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗拒不了耸动新闻 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't resist a good story, could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.60,0:55:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么脑残 我是担心你才会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be an idiot, Dewey. I'm here because I was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.87,0:55:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 制作人当然要我报导这新闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yes. My producers wanted me to cover this, for obvious reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.97,0:55:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有九成是因为你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but 90% is because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.81,0:55:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉有九成好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I feel 90% better.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.91,0:55:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么玻璃心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.68,0:55:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几时关心过我的心情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when did you care about my feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.65,0:55:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是这两年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially not in the last couple years.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.27,0:55:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 别假装是我要离婚的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen. Let's not pretend I'm the one who ended things.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.55,0:55:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人在假装 我记得是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's pretending, Gale. I remember what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.69,0:55:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没穿制服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you in uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.83,0:55:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我退休了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.26,0:55:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.90,0:55:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我退休的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since they asked me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.70,0:55:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 杜威{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.80,0:55:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你可怜我 盖儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need your pity, Gale.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.74,0:55:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了选择 你也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my choices. So did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.07,0:55:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也该轮到我了 那是个好机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my turn. It was a great opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.18,0:55:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说会试试看 - 我试过啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said you'd try. - And I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.35,0:55:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,才两个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For two whole months!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.41,0:55:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想让我更内疚 祝好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if you want to make me feel worse than I already do, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.35,0:55:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上还不错 我能看你的节目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mornings aren't so bad, 'cause I get to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.75,0:56:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装我还在纽约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretend I'm still back there in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.42,0:56:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后才想起来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.53,0:56:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受不了 才会半夜走人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I couldn't hack it. I left in the middle of the night…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.17,0:56:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个孬种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.93,0:56:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时为什么不说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't you tell me that then?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.54,0:56:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想办法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.74,0:56:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有很多缺点 杜威{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a lot of things, Dewey…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.81,0:56:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝不是孬种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you are not a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.41,0:56:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.68,0:56:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,注定要待在伍兹柏勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just were meant to be in Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.78,0:56:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you weren't?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.49,0:56:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我保证你会尽快离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me you'll leave as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.92,0:56:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不能保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't promise that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.50,0:56:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为茱蒂的死感到遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.20,0:56:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.37,0:56:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她会是你下一本书精彩的一章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she'll make a great chapter in your next book.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.51,0:56:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说鬼脸杀手全新的招牌凶器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't even get me started on Ghostface's signature new weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.38,0:56:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的超猛的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shit is lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.18,0:56:59.68,Title,0,0,0,0,,为什么要用《惊声尖叫》一样的片名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And can we talk about the title? Stab?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.45,0:57:05.75,Title,0,0,0,0,,明明是《惊声尖叫8》 你骗不了人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call it Stab 8. It's fucking Stab 8. You're not fooling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.89,0:57:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太扯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's such bullsh…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.12,0:57:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪没事吧 - 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been? You okay? Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.93,0:57:12.93,Title,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂没在唬烂 《惊声尖叫8》不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Mindy girl wasn't kidding. Stab 8 is not like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.06,0:57:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟其他电影无关 没有经典角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, no connection to the other movies. No legacy characters at all. Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.37,0:57:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个电影系列从第五集就走歪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me, this franchise goes off the rails with number five.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.94,0:57:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 他又杀死两个人 卫斯和他妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie, listen to me. He killed two more people. Wes and his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.61,0:57:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀死警长这么厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed the sheriff? You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.21,0:57:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧你在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, are you okay? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.48,0:57:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我再打给你 - 不 珊曼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll call you right back. - No, Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.75,0:57:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's at the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.79,0:57:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在保护我妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's watching my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.32,0:57:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚得知警长的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just heard about the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.76,0:57:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里需要我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They needed me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.69,0:57:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪 - 我妹有危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - My sister's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.76,0:57:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,…茱蒂希克斯惨遭杀害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Judy Hicks has just been brutally murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.67,0:58:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在等什么开车啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for? Drive!
