Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.40,0:58:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.41,0:58:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,管它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.95,0:58:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.04,0:59:24.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（珊曼来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.74,0:59:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.27,0:59:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该边开车边打电话吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should you really be making a phone call right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.14,0:59:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.77,1:00:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车你知道我们得活着才能救她 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! You know we have to live through this to help her, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.01,1:00:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.46,1:01:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.91,1:01:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死的 - 瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goddamn it! - Richie?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.37,1:01:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.74,1:01:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼打来 她说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam called. She said that…
