Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.58,1:01:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你用手机K我 - 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you hit me with the phone? - Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.99,1:02:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.46,1:02:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在医院吗 - 你好 珊曼莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you at the hospital? - Hello, Samantha.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.06,1:02:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇现在不能接电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie can't come to the phone right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.27,1:02:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会知道随便乱入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's finding out what happens to people.
