Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.34,1:02:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What? Tera!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.61,1:02:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想听到谁死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you want to hear die?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.78,1:02:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求求你 别伤害他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please! I'm begging you. Please don't hurt them.
