Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.91,1:02:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉别碰她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara! Don't touch her!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.59,1:02:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, please. I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.43,1:02:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是说 杀死塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or say, "Kill Tara, "
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.16,1:02:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会用力捅上次没捅到的器官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll make sure to hit all the organs I missed last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.90,1:02:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.63,1:02:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 别伤害她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you. Please don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.24,1:02:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次机会 选择吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last chance to save one. Choose!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.34,1:02:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.91,1:03:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know why, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.61,1:03:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为你是自私的贱货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's because you're a selfish bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.65,1:03:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,连决定要救你爱的人都没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can't even make a decision to save the life of someone you love.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.38,1:03:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你在这个电影系列太弱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're too weak for this franchise.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.06,1:03:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你说的对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.56,1:03:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我只是在拖延时间 猪头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe I'm just stalling for time, fuckhead.
