Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.97,1:03:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.27,1:03:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.03,1:03:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.51,1:03:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我扶你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.14,1:03:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.51,1:03:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进电梯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the elevator!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.87,1:04:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天不会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.89,1:04:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.74,1:04:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快闪吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.97,1:04:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 快点 - 噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, hurry up. - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.04,1:04:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 头部 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The head. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.77,1:04:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要打爆头 不然凶手一定会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to shoot 'em in the head, or they always come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.37,1:04:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 谁会管这么多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dewey! Who gives a fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.48,1:04:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会 - 不杜威{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do. - No! Dewey!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.68,1:05:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, today.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.22,1:05:46.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（盖儿来电）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.54,1:05:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.82,1:06:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.42,1:06:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.65,1:06:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.17,1:07:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.40,1:07:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他不熟 但…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know him well, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.51,1:07:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮助过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he helped me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.54,1:07:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是这种人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.01,1:07:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是在帮助别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped people.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.68,1:07:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该拦住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.75,1:07:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来我妹就会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had, my sister would be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.12,1:07:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼莎 你妹妹醒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samantha, your sister's awake.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.38,1:08:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.18,1:08:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,席妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.28,1:08:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一听说就赶来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came as soon as I heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.95,1:08:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.83,1:08:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.53,1:08:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不该来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here either.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.21,1:08:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马克和孩子们呢 - 他们很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mark and the kids are okay? - Yeah, they're safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.84,1:08:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是来做个了结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to make sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.28,1:08:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.23,1:08:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.40,1:08:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次遇袭都会有更好的止痛药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I get attacked, they give me better painkillers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.50,1:08:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.70,1:09:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.27,1:09:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛抱歉你救了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what? You saved my life.
