Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.25,1:09:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是爸离开的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For being the reason Dad left.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.98,1:09:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是爸离开的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the reason Dad left.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.02,1:09:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能选择你来自哪或是谁的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't choose where you came from. Or who you came from.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.82,1:09:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不怪你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.39,1:09:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只怪你也离开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I blame you for leaving me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.39,1:09:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再离开你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's never gonna happen again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.60,1:09:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.67,1:09:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时为什么不告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why didn't you come to me back then?
