Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.94,1:09:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.57,1:09:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared.
