Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.28,1:09:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕会变得跟他一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared that I would turn out just like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.09,1:09:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才会逃走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I ran.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.75,1:09:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.56,1:09:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不被我伤害 - 珊曼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- From me. - Sam…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.26,1:10:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都不会跟他一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could never be like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.97,1:10:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在很嗨 - 我超嗨的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're so high right now. - I'm so high right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.50,1:10:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都懒得骗你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even gonna lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.28,1:10:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.78,1:10:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.75,1:10:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.09,1:10:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,做遇到这种情况没人做过的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What nobody ever does in these situations.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.93,1:10:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻离开伍兹柏勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get the fuck out of Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.30,1:10:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是她 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's her? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.04,1:10:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samantha?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.74,1:10:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我珊曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.88,1:10:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是… - 我知道你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm… - I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.68,1:10:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.05,1:10:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很抱歉… - 你是比利的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen, I'm sorry… - You're Billy's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.42,1:11:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去把车开过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll bring the car around.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.83,1:11:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是他的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.66,1:11:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉让你觉得不舒服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry if that's weird for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.50,1:11:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的 只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.64,1:11:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经历过这种事 很多次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been through this. A lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.54,1:11:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,想谈谈吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.67,1:11:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.24,1:11:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.98,1:11:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾杜威死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry about Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.38,1:11:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要带我妹远离这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm taking my sister away from all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.19,1:11:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也逃跑过 没有用 凶手一定会跟来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried running too. It doesn't work, it always follows.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.79,1:11:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 那是你 不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All due respect, that's your life, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.73,1:11:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没这么简单 - 你要我怎样 大妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not so sure about that. - What do you want from me, lady?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.53,1:11:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么毒舌 呛妞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Watch your tone, new girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.93,1:11:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手一定和原版角色有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how they always say it goes back to the original?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.87,1:11:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the original.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.50,1:11:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.97,1:11:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你错了 这也与你有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're wrong, this is your life now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.51,1:11:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这代表凶手会一直追杀你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means whoever this is will keep coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.21,1:11:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以呢 - 我要你帮我们杀死他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So I want you to help us kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.54,1:12:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我帮你和晨间节目主播杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to help you and the host of a morning show commit murder?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.92,1:12:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Correct. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.08,1:12:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要扮演什么角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm what in this scenario?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.79,1:12:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,诱饵无助受害者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bait? The helpless victim?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.32,1:12:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 适合的话… - 你并不无助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If the shoe fits… - You're not helpless, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.33,1:12:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀死你的和我们的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed your friend, he killed ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.46,1:12:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有小孩 他一天不死我就一天睡不着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have kids, which means I won't sleep until he's in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.03,1:12:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉这危害到你们的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry about what this has done to your lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.07,1:12:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管你们或任何人怎么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no matter what you or the killer or anyone says,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.61,1:12:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this isn't my story.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.44,1:12:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们快闪吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Let's get the fuck out of town, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.41,1:12:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 那是我男友瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. That's my boyfriend, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.51,1:12:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到…我们见过面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet… We met.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.35,1:12:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车 永远别再见到这些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, please get in the car so we never have to see these people again.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.02,1:12:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珊曼… - 不 我们要离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam… - No. We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.32,1:12:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样才能保护塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only way I can protect Tara.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.29,1:12:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 祝好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.10,1:12:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.00,1:12:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被她打脸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that went fucking horribly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.54,1:12:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我有计划 她是个悍妞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I have a plan. She seems really tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.21,1:13:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 她再悍也没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, Sid, who gives a shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.54,1:13:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也说凶手会追杀她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it yourself, he's gonna go after her.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.71,1:13:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在她车上放了追踪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put a tracker on her car.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.15,1:13:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.27,1:13:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是盖儿魏德斯会做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed like something Gale Weathers would do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.85,1:13:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算是赞美啰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.87,1:13:11.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（离开伍兹柏勒）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.59,1:13:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留言给妈 说我们要去哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left a message for Mom. I told her where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.18,1:13:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.39,1:13:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.76,1:13:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.10,1:13:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的吸入器 我都有备用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My inhaler. I usually keep an extra one.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.53,1:13:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该回去吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we go back?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.60,1:13:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不想回去那间杀人医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Okay. I vote for not going back to the murder hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.10,1:13:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去药局呢 - 我需要处方笺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to stop at a pharmacy? - I'd need a prescription.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.44,1:13:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,安珀家有一个 我们会路过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I left an extra one at Amber's. Her house is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.70,1:13:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.88,1:13:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be in and out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.25,1:13:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能撑到莫德斯托吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you hold out till Modesto?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.92,1:13:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能 - 地址是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think so. - Okay, what's the address?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.15,1:13:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别肖想路123号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}123 No Fucking Way Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.95,1:13:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇 她很需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie, she needs it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.75,1:13:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也需要活下去 你也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need to keep all the blood inside my body. So do you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.39,1:13:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.46,1:13:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.30,1:13:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 靠 地址是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah. Fuck. What's the goddamn address?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.12,1:14:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 多谢光临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.00,1:14:17.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纪念卫斯）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.09,1:14:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒好倒满 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep pouring, Wheeler. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.56,1:14:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬卫斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Wes! To Wes!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.56,1:14:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,暖男一枚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.00,1:14:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你唷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We love you, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.46,1:14:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,灌酒 真假这是追悼会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shots, really? This is supposed to be a memorial.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.97,1:14:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我追悼的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is how I mourn.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.57,1:14:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便忘掉死神随时会降临的事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and distract myself from the looming specter of Death.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.97,1:14:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 啤酒快没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're low on beer.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.61,1:14:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室还有 我去拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more in the basement. I'll go get some.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.75,1:15:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼 敏蒂天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck, Mindy? Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.75,1:15:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是考验 你失败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a test. And you failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.69,1:15:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有面具杀手在 不能单独行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never go off on your own with a masked killer around.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.26,1:15:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,明明是你说要更多啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one that said we needed more beer.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.29,1:15:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该叫我跟你来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should have asked me to come with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.30,1:15:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有面具杀手在还不能做什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what else you shouldn't do when there's a masked killer around?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.83,1:15:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.47,1:15:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,单独跟着别人到阴森恐怖的地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow someone into a dark, creepy basement alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.61,1:15:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.54,1:15:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎知我不是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you know I'm not the killer?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.72,1:15:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我才是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.79,1:15:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.25,1:16:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这是个教训 别相信任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let that be a lesson. Don't trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.89,1:16:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我怎么能相信你不是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how can I trust you when you say you're not the killer?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.53,1:16:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.73,1:16:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你学得很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're learning.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.40,1:16:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到楼上吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's go back upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.41,1:16:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.81,1:16:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.86,1:16:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think… Think I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.33,1:16:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该嘿咻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I think we should.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.23,1:16:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在 想去楼上吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like now. You want to go upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.00,1:16:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去楼上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like… Like upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.50,1:16:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿啊 现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.94,1:16:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会喔 但还是不要比较好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take this the wrong way, but I think I have to pass on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.18,1:16:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.52,1:17:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.59,1:17:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我不能完全确定你不是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm not like entirely sure that you're not the…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.39,1:17:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.56,1:17:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't take this the wrong way"?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.53,1:17:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没啦 我有九成九确定你不是 但…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, look. I'm almost 100% certain that you are not,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.93,1:17:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里比较安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the safest option is to be down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.87,1:17:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all the people…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.01,1:17:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.44,1:17:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是证人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the potential witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.94,1:17:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会森七七很正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a completely valid emotional response to have.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.41,1:17:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那也是 - 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That too. - Fucking asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.92,1:17:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.82,1:17:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Mindy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.97,1:17:38.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（离开伍兹柏勒）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.99,1:17:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没写关于你妈的那本书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't have written that book about your mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.99,1:17:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这一切都不会发生 - 盖儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- none of this would've happened. - Gale.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.19,1:17:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都是我的错 - 并不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I started all of this. - No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.33,1:17:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是比利鲁米斯的错 我们要做个了结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Loomis started this, and we're gonna end it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.10,1:17:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了今晚不会再有书 电影和鬼脸杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After tonight, no more books, no more movies, no more fucking Ghostface.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.14,1:17:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们不知道法则吗 - 什么法则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you know the rules? - What rules?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.58,1:18:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,想在恐怖片中活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are specific rules that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.08,1:18:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有生存法则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}must abide by to successfully survive a horror movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.78,1:18:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一条法则：绝对不能爱爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For instance, number one…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.45,1:18:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别出去找她 - 她没回我讯息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it. Don't go outside after her. She's not texting me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.39,1:18:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她大概挂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she's probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.79,1:18:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 敏蒂 她是我女友 我爱她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Mindy. That's my girlfriend, and I love her.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.76,1:18:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,前女友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.70,1:18:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只想看一部我们舅舅被杀的电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna sit and watch a movie about our uncle getting stabbed?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.87,1:18:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能让我冷静 好吗我也要哈草{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It calms me down, okay? I'm also gonna smoke some weed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.55,1:18:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许跟法兰丝上床{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and possibly hook up with Frances.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.54,1:18:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩得开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.77,1:18:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,吼 至少拿个武器吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, at least take some sort of weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.98,1:18:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.01,1:18:55.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（找到我再弥补我）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.79,1:18:59.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（定位要求）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.12,1:19:01.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（丽芙接受定位要求 分享位置）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.26,1:19:05.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（愿意与丽芙分享位置吗）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.62,1:19:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽芙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liv?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.40,1:19:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽芙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liv?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.29,1:19:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不玩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay, yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.43,1:20:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.75,1:20:37.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（结束分享位置）
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.76,1:21:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Stop! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.71,1:21:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 她在开趴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, perfect. She's having a party.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.62,1:21:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会在这时候开趴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has a party in the middle of a killing spree?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.75,1:21:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 中止计划 - 不 来都来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I'm aborting the plan. - No, we're already here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.15,1:21:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会快去快回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go in quickly and get it. I'll be back in five.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.09,1:21:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.32,1:21:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会留在车上等死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think I'm waiting out here just to get murdered,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.89,1:21:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.71,1:21:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.47,1:21:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会出院到处趴趴走好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing out of the hospital? Should you even be up and around?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.78,1:21:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要吸入器 - 你要去哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need my spare inhaler. - Why? Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.78,1:22:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 别告诉我 注意安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine. Don't tell me. I get it. Just be safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.42,1:22:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该在我房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's in my room.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.36,1:22:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙儿 多谢光临 但派对结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everyone! Thanks for coming, but the party's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.43,1:22:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该走人了 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time to go! - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.76,1:22:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还早啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's so early!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.23,1:22:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.57,1:22:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 拜托 把音乐关掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! Hello! Can we cut the music, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.37,1:22:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 Z世代 大家好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hi… Gen Z. How are you? Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.64,1:22:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼和塔拉都被凶手攻击两次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both Sam and Tara here have been attacked by the killer twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.52,1:22:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们来了 这地方就是目标 所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now they're here, which makes this place a huge murder target, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.52,1:22:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,换作是我就会闪人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I were you, I would probably leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.92,1:22:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不鸟我是吗快滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I tried to be nice. Get the fuck out!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.56,1:22:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托快滚吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please get the fuck out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.46,1:22:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请快滚 - 扫兴鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sincerely, get the fuck out. - Buzzkill!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.73,1:22:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家 我这是在救你们的小命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you all. I'm saving your life. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.63,1:22:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 小屁孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, teens.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.91,1:22:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.17,1:23:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 乱丢纸杯 多谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for leaving the cup. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.21,1:23:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在救你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.28,1:23:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是在救你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saving your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.22,1:23:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,救你们的小命 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving your life, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.92,1:23:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三条法则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And number three:
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.75,1:23:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在任何情况下 千万不要说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never, ever, ever, under any circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.29,1:23:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,“我马上回来”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}say, "I'll be right back."
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.26,1:23:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you won't be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.09,1:23:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个傻大叔把我们赶出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, somebody's goofy-ass dad's kicking us out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.23,1:23:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.73,1:23:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢啦 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, guys, have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.47,1:23:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有我的号码 - 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have my number. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.58,1:23:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.25,1:23:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有啤酒吗厨房没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any beer left? There's none in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.78,1:23:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啊 地下室还有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Richie, there's beer in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.45,1:23:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,门就在你后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right behind you. Basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.99,1:23:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.99,1:23:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想跟我去吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to, uh, come with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.06,1:23:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想 但你是该这么问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But you were right to ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.23,1:23:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.80,1:24:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我马上回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll be right back… Aha!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.51,1:24:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Yeah. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.01,1:24:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.78,1:24:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的优步司机给我放鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The goddamn fucking Uber canceled on me!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.01,1:24:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我不能爱爱也不能回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Now I can't have sex, and I can't get a ride home.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.52,1:24:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚还会更惨吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could this night get any shittier?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.25,1:24:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽芙 我哥咧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liv, where's my brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.36,1:24:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 大概去指控大家是凶手吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I don't know, Mindy. Probably off accusing everyone of being the killer!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.79,1:24:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他其实是去找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He actually went looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.90,1:24:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到他 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see him. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.34,1:24:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛那样看我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.90,1:24:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在修改嫌犯名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just revising my suspect list.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.54,1:24:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.62,1:24:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在怕我 敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you afraid of me, Mindy?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.65,1:24:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我对你哥做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I did something to your brother? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.69,1:24:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会…杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm gonna… cut you up?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.66,1:25:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有一点了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bit now… yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.67,1:25:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明明说我太无趣不会是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said I was too boring to be the killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.67,1:25:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许那才是超展开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.61,1:25:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得咧你是专家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, huh? You're the expert.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.65,1:25:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道专家都有什么下场吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what eventually happens to the expert?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.82,1:25:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.29,1:25:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你的蠢电影吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy your stupid movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.43,1:25:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个神经病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking psycho.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.50,1:25:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们停车了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.13,1:25:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油站 - 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gas station? - No. I…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.30,1:25:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 惨了 - 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.47,1:25:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 还有多远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. How far are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.68,1:25:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,太远了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too far.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.44,1:25:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.78,1:25:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉 要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara, we're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.94,1:25:57.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（席妮皮斯考克来电）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.59,1:25:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.92,1:26:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得马上离开那栋房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get out of that house right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.72,1:26:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know where I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.86,1:26:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是史都马克家 他和你爸杀人的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in Stu Macher's house, where your dad and Stu killed everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.00,1:26:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人把你骗到那里 你得赶快离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone planned to get you there. You need to get the fuck out, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.47,1:26:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 洁美 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Jamie. Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.64,1:26:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 洁美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out, Jamie.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.41,1:26:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他在附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he's around.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.81,1:26:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 他就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.15,1:26:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 转过去 快转过去啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, turn around! Turn around! Dude!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.25,1:26:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说了 他就在角落 洁美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. I told you, he's around the corner. Jamie.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.86,1:26:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看后面 - 不 蓝迪 看看你后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look behind you. - No, Randy, look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.96,1:26:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 快转过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, turn around!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.96,1:26:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪头 你在干嘛你行的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what are you doing? You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.43,1:26:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的法则 快啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are your rules! Own that shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.50,1:26:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你后面 转过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind you! Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.57,1:26:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look behind…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.79,1:26:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,洁美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jamie.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.31,1:26:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 惨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.16,1:27:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我流了很多血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy. That's a lot of blood, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.83,1:27:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂 保持清醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mindy, stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.97,1:27:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对她做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.94,1:27:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. No, I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.07,1:27:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凶手他… - 她没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The killer, he… - Mindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.81,1:27:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.88,1:27:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇 你去了哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie, where the fuck were you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.48,1:27:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去地下室拿啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went into the basement to get beer.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.94,1:27:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人去地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went to the basement alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.21,1:27:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫她跟我去 她不肯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked her to come with me! She said no!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.05,1:27:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Stay the fuck back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.15,1:27:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.42,1:27:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直陪着塔拉 你们都在趴趴走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with Tara, but the rest of you were wandering around.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.16,1:27:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of you is the fucking killer!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.86,1:27:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 安珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Amber. Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.43,1:27:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的手怎么会有血迹 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why is there blood on your hands? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.23,1:27:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我找到查德 他… - 查德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I found Chad and he's… - Chad?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.50,1:27:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说谎 - 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're fucking lying. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.87,1:27:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是凶手 - 我不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're the killer. - No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.04,1:27:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽芙 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liv, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.11,1:27:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去你的 - 丽芙 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck you! - Liv, just stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.31,1:28:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 我不是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Amber. I'm not the fucking killer!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.18,1:28:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.62,1:28:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到第三幕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to act three.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.09,1:28:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.46,1:28:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.66,1:28:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珊曼 快来 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, come on! - No…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.09,1:28:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑快快快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Go, go, go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.83,1:28:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 塔拉 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God… Tara! - Wait, no, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.07,1:28:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她有枪 - 瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She has a gun. - Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.13,1:28:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且一定有两个凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are always two killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.01,1:28:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼 把刀放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, please put the knife down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.25,1:28:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I think…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.95,1:28:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另一个凶手可能是塔拉 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The other killer might be Tara. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.35,1:28:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她带我们来这里 你们也很久没见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the one that brought us here, and you two have been estranged for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.62,1:28:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.66,1:28:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对她有多了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how well do you really know her?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.79,1:28:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,比对你了解的更多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than I know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.43,1:28:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 珊曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, wait, whoa. Sam!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.78,1:29:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定出事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.82,1:29:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.92,1:29:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好当然没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this? Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.69,1:29:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.47,1:29:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊他刺伤我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, help me! He stabbed me!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.77,1:29:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得呢 - 陷阱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think? - Trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.67,1:29:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,管它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.74,1:29:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale! Gale!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.44,1:29:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Let me see. Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.01,1:29:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得去医院 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got to go to the hospital. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.38,1:29:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说要做个了结 去吧 席妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said we were gonna finish this. Go finish it, Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.32,1:29:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.89,1:29:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了杜威{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.90,1:30:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来的人 不管是不是凶手 快出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone hiding, killer or not, you have five seconds to show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.93,1:31:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.37,1:31:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.68,1:31:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.88,1:31:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊曼 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.09,1:31:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 席妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sidney!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.79,1:31:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你去了哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello there. Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.03,1:31:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是安珀 我是另一个凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this isn't Amber. I'm the other one.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.17,1:31:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 又有两个凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. There's two of you. Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.70,1:31:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过这部电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen this movie before.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.41,1:31:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看过这部电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this movie, Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.31,1:31:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的需要新点子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really need some new material.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.54,1:31:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你回来了 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you here, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.35,1:32:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最没有创意的一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might actually be the most derivative one of all.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.82,1:32:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 同一栋房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Christ, the same house?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.35,1:32:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧 但你忘了第一条生存法则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe so. But you forgot the first rule of surviving a Stab movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.79,1:32:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝对不能接… - 太无聊了 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never answer the… - I'm bored. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.93,1:32:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来你在这里干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands up! Show me your hands! What are you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.17,1:32:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲避凶手啊 我叫你出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding from murderers. I told you to come out!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.60,1:32:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不要你会向我开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna come out! You're shooting everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.17,1:32:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠北 是鬼脸杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit, it's Ghostface!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.16,1:32:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇 快去拿枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie! Gun. Get the gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.16,1:32:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你射伤我的腿很难耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, kind of hard since you shot me in the leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.11,1:32:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好耶 - 向他开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! Yes! - Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.04,1:33:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好你没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.18,1:33:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I really,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.25,1:33:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很想亲手杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}really wanted to be the one to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.82,1:33:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下来 皮斯考克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit the fuck down, Prescott!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.45,1:33:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一招真的奏效了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.49,1:33:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 凶手就是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's a bummer it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.06,1:33:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是这部电影最好的人选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it really was the best choice for the movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.20,1:33:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a fucking movie!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.64,1:34:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后会改编成电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But it will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.77,1:34:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这才是重点 对吧安珀 - 对啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the point, right, Amber? - Right, hon!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.71,1:34:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三幕大屠杀 有 凶手揭晓 有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third act bloodbath, check. Killers revealed, check.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.65,1:34:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,该上演大结局了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for the big finale!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.18,1:34:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞奇… - 嘘嘘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Richie… - Shh, shh…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.99,1:34:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.16,1:34:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带到厨房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get 'em into the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.13,1:34:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 贱货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.46,1:34:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人拯救这个电影系列{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has to save the franchise.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.70,1:34:32.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,第一集《惊声尖叫》后就没有好的续集{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, no one has made a great Stab movie since the first one.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.14,1:34:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.24,1:34:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 去把前任莱利太太拖进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby, you want to go get the very ex-Mrs. Riley?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.69,1:34:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.08,1:34:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.18,1:34:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa… whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.81,1:34:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,席妮皮斯考克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sidney Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.18,1:34:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.22,1:34:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你真正的铁粉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a really big fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.69,1:34:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go fuck yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.59,1:34:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看过上一集吗 我不爱看恐怖片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see the last Stab movie? Not really a fan of scary movies.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.39,1:34:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你聪明 那部电影烂透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That checks out. Anyway, it sucked balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.76,1:35:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没人在乎真正的粉丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because nobody takes the true fans seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.30,1:35:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家只会笑我们 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just laugh at us, and why?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.93,1:35:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们热爱恐怖片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we love something?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.10,1:35:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是个笑话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just a fucking joke to them?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.91,1:35:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷文化怎么会有毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can fandom be toxic?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.68,1:35:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是爱看电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about love!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.41,1:35:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道这些电影对粉丝有多重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't fucking understand that these movies are important to people.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.11,1:35:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞奇… - 但我们会帮他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Richie… - We're gonna help them!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.62,1:35:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好莱坞早就没有新点子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hollywood's totally fucking out of ideas,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.05,1:35:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就决定给他们全新的题材{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we decided we'd give them some new source material to follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.49,1:35:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,回归基本故事概念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, bring it back to basics.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.46,1:35:31.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,才能拍出伟大的《惊声尖叫》电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's how you make a great Stab movie, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.76,1:35:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,改编自真实事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Based on actual events."
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.00,1:35:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 盖儿 - 给我坐好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gale. - Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.40,1:35:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up. Back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.34,1:35:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这么做只是让我当电影的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did all this just to make me the hero of your fucked-up movie?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.35,1:35:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你不是英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, you're not the hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.42,1:35:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是大反派{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the villain.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.85,1:36:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,会看到她老爸比利鲁米斯幻影的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The daughter of Billy Loomis who sees fucked-up visions of her dead dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.42,1:36:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,席妮皮斯考克杀死你爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sidney Prescott killed your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.59,1:36:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.93,1:36:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的一切都是为了把她带回伍兹柏勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}did all this just to get her back to Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.00,1:36:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这些电影最大的问题是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what the biggest problem with the Stab movies is?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.70,1:36:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有麦克迈尔斯或杰森沃尔希斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no Michael Myers or Jason Voorhees.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.01,1:36:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一直回来的大坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bad guy to keep coming back.
