Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.28,1:36:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是超屌的大反派{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's a fucking villain.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.85,1:36:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道 - 你爸的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you know? - About your father?
