Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.80,1:36:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要上你也不难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't that hard for me to fuck you, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.24,1:36:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我猜性活跃的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I guess being a sexually available woman.
