Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.77,1:36:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.98,1:36:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是在引用原版电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now you're just quoting the original.
