Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.22,1:37:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 席妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.39,1:37:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不能饶过你 你老是死不了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let you live either. I mean, surviving this many times…
