Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.22,1:47:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再丢下你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not going anywhere without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.86,1:47:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.29,1:47:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一直握着你的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hold your hand all the way there.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.61,1:47:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,25年前的这时候 就在这栋房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-five years ago, almost to the day, in this very house.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.49,1:47:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场悲剧结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a tragic story ended.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.19,1:47:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 全新的篇章也将结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, a new chapter came to a close.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.22,1:47:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方目前仍在搜证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police do not have a lot of information right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.49,1:47:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握的线索不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as they are still collecting evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.49,1:47:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是一个死伤惨重的犯罪现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, this is a very active crime scene here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.53,1:47:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有实际的伤亡人数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unknown number of fatalities, several injuries,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.37,1:47:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些伤患正被救护车送去医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}some people being taken off by ambulance right now as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.97,1:47:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是持续发展的新闻…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a developing story…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.27,1:48:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,献给卫斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Wes.
